  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACB Institutional Support 2014-2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This agreement seeks to provide funding to the Anti Corruption Bureau Malawi (ACB)  to continue activities to fight corruption. The overall goal of the program is to reduce corruption levels in Malawi. The outcome of the project is to build capacity of ACB in order to sustain and consolidate progress made through  previous funding support by DFID, Irish Aid and Norway.</narrative>
  </description>
